{"text":"彌勒佛像。夫一餐之錫，終古尚稱，況見拯九淵，惠同造化。慧樂旦淪俗苦，晚悟法津，蒙北海大王落髮入道，表裏催濟，兼忘夙霄。今率貧資，以申前志，謹造像一區，託宣三寶。西果庶幾，永鍾北海。群生動植，各各至音；親識存亡，普沾其趣。魏景明四年十二月一日，比丘慧樂爲侍中、太傅、領司徒、録尚書事北海王元詳造。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":0,"end":2},{"name":"PersonName","term":"慧樂","refId":null,"text":"慧樂","start":27,"end":29},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"苦","refId":null,"text":"俗苦","start":31,"end":33},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"佛法","refId":null,"text":"法津","start":36,"end":38},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"出家","refId":null,"text":"落髮入道","start":44,"end":48},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三寶","refId":null,"text":"三寶","start":77,"end":79},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"群生","start":90,"end":92},{"name":"PersonName","term":"慧樂","refId":null,"text":"慧樂","start":123,"end":125},{"name":"Office","term":"侍中","refId":null,"text":"侍中","start":126,"end":128},{"name":"Office","term":"太傅","refId":null,"text":"太傅","start":129,"end":131},{"name":"Office","term":"司徒","refId":null,"text":"司徒","start":133,"end":135},{"name":"Office","term":"録尚書事","refId":null,"text":"録尚書事","start":136,"end":140},{"name":"PersonName","term":"元詳","refId":null,"text":"元詳","start":143,"end":145}]}